    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist now.</h1><p>Add the game to your Wishlist to not miss out on anything new!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/877f0a453690285ba2a1785abbb622c8.poster.avif?t=1743180368\" width=600 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/877f0a453690285ba2a1785abbb622c8.webm?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/877f0a453690285ba2a1785abbb622c8.mp4?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a lone cyberpunk swordsman with a cool trick up their sleeve\u2014learning and copying enemy skills. This game is all about turn-based action in a futuristic cyberpunk world, where strategic positioning on the 2D playing field is crucial as you battle your way to confront the final boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based Action: Strategize every move as each character takes their turn. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/a563e6863d4b8f8cf9c120f4a033f89c.poster.avif?t=1743180368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/a563e6863d4b8f8cf9c120f4a033f89c.webm?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/a563e6863d4b8f8cf9c120f4a033f89c.mp4?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rogue-like Gameplay with Progression: Encounter new enemies during gameplay, defeat them to unlock their unique skills. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/166d211ca1d23662b8422f1c261f2ab1.poster.avif?t=1743180368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/166d211ca1d23662b8422f1c261f2ab1.webm?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/166d211ca1d23662b8422f1c261f2ab1.mp4?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deck Building Elements: Experiment with various combos and construct your starter deck to bring with you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/9e7c02d7b93151f2d4197228f4c4b8f4.poster.avif?t=1743180368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/9e7c02d7b93151f2d4197228f4c4b8f4.webm?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/9e7c02d7b93151f2d4197228f4c4b8f4.mp4?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability: Experience randomized enemies in each run, ensuring no two runs are alike. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique enemies: Encounter diverse enemies, each bringing a new challenge to overcome. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/531449624f8d1ee198b45c995c425c25.poster.avif?t=1743180368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/531449624f8d1ee198b45c995c425c25.webm?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/531449624f8d1ee198b45c995c425c25.mp4?t=1743180368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique maps: Each part of the game has a unique set of enemies, synergizing with each other, bringing new challenges. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day though, it\u2019s YOUR skills as a player that matter most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a journey of continual improvement, transforming once-daunting obstacles into a stroll in the park.</p>",
